{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Not personally, but I know some who could vote on a good one.\" Roy taps on his shoulder, prompting a large group of bugs to fly from out of pockets and sleeves, and on a hand signal they scatter around, looking for flowers. A bigger group gathers around one specific type growing nearby, red petals with white lines along them.\n\"That one, perhaps.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T17:35:11.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870358811435757591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
