{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"The speaker finishes covering his body. He lights his candle and leaves it at the foot of the grave. He nods towards Sabrine, thankful for her touch. He opens his tarot deck and leaves the fool card right next to the candle. Why he did this he is unsure, he just felt like doing it.","created_at":"2021-07-29T17:57:52.254000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870364520399376464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"After a moment of silence, he approaches Eliza. He puts 1 platinum coin in her palm. \"Thank you for what you have done here. I am immensely grateful, please take this as my appreciation. I insist.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T17:58:47.868000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870364753661407242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
