{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yes that is right.\" The Speaker smirks at Roy. \"It marks endless potential as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T17:59:45.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870364995471413248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Kukudh nods.","created_at":"2021-07-29T17:59:55.015000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365035296333855","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"He looks over to his grave. \"Time to see what this fool has become.\" He nods at everyone who attended and gives an even bigger nod towards the Mender. \"Now if you all may excuse me, I have somewhere to be.\" He says as he walks away from the hill slowly and silently.","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:00:48.675000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365260362711100","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Ah, Speaker, wait a second.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:00:59.385000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365305283682406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'You said you couldn't understand Common without the spell Mender cast, correct?'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:01:14.037000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365366738624563","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"The Speaker turns towards Sabrine. \"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:01:18.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365386615455774","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Try putting some theurgic essences into a hat or helm. It won't help you speak, but you'll be able to understand languages, at least.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:02:07.006000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365588906725376","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'As far as I can tell with mine, I can understand all of them. That must be helpful for one who speaks with the dead.'","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:02:35.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365707483893850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I shall take your advice with gratitude. A speaker who cannot speak is a painful irony.\" He says with a small chuckle.","created_at":"2021-07-29T18:03:44.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870365996249120828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
